Frida (frida-gum)

FLEXAiFlexFrida.m links the frida-gum static library, distributed as
frida-gum-devkit from:

https://github.com/frida/frida

Copyright (C) 2010-2026 Ole André Vadla Ravnås <oleavr@gmail.com>
Licensed under the wxWindows Library Licence, Version 3.1
(an LGPL 2.1 derivative with a static-linking exception).

The licence text is available at:
https://github.com/frida/frida/blob/main/COPYING

AiFlex3 uses frida-gum in a read-only capacity only: module and symbol
enumeration, thread listing, memory range enumeration, bounds-checked memory
reads, hex pattern scanning, and crash log retrieval. No inline hooking,
memory writing, code patching, or Stalker instrumentation is performed, and
GumJS is not bundled.

Full corresponding source for the unmodified frida-gum library is available
from the upstream repository at the release tag recorded in
.github/workflows/build.yml. Linking is static against the official devkit
build of that tag; rebuild instructions are the upstream releng scripts
(frida/releng) for the ios-arm64 target.


