Note on version pinning: the headers under x/capstone/include are 5.0.1 to
match the implementation embedded in frida-gum. They must not be bumped to
6.x independently — Capstone 6 changed the internal layout of cs_detail
(MAX_IMPL_W_REGS 47 vs 20, MAX_NUM_GROUPS 16 vs 8, union offset 154 vs 92),
so mixing 6.x headers with the 5.0.1 implementation silently misreads arm64
operands. x/capstone/*.c is kept in the tree for reference but is excluded
from the build for the same reason.
